    "case_for": "B012 remains the strongest, most delimited achievement: a virological insight was translated into effective virus-like-particle vaccines with durable prevention of HPV infection and related cancers. The supplied evidence supports exceptional maturity through long-term clinical and public-health impact, while Lowy, Frazer, and Schiller form a coherent three-person attribution spanning the foundational vaccine work and development.",
