      },
      {
        "member_id": "el-manira-abdel",
        "point": "El Manira places B018 ahead of GLP-1 because chaperonin-assisted folding established a fundamental and highly attributable cellular principle.",
        "response": "The Hartl-Horwich pairing is notably crisp and the discovery is deeply mature. I would retain it as an alternative, but B012 more directly combines a specific scientific discovery with an established preventive effect against major human cancers."
      }
